{"id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-clone.md","title":"Clone","display":"df-clone — Clone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-clone","aliases":["93-df-clone"],"display":"df-clone — Clone","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-clone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-clone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clone — Clone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a set and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is a class of finitary operation candidates on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Super}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Super}_{93}\\)</span> are the explicitly defined projection, argument-tuple, and superposition constructors.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clone}\">\\(\\mathrm{Clone}\\)</span> is the clone predicate defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\">\\(\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf g:n\\to(A^m\\to A)\">\\(\\mathbf g:n\\to(A^m\\to A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in A^m\">\\(\\bar a\\in A^m\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A^n\\to A\">\\(f:A^n\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf g:n\\to(A^m\\to A)\">\\(\\mathbf g:n\\to(A^m\\to A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar a(i)\\rangle:\\bar a\\in A^n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar a(i)\\rangle:\\bar a\\in A^n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\mathbf g(j)(\\bar a)\\rangle:j&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\mathbf g(j)(\\bar a)\\rangle:j&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar a,\nf\\bigl(\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar a\\in A^m\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar a,\nf\\bigl(\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar a\\in A^m\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash{}&amp;A\\neq\\varnothing\\land m,n\\in\\omega\n\\land f:A^n\\to A\\land\\mathbf g\\in(A^m\\to A)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall\\bar a\\in A^m\\;\n\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\in A^n\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n):A^m\\to A\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash{}&amp;A\\neq\\varnothing\\land m,n\\in\\omega\n\\land f:A^n\\to A\\land\\mathbf g\\in(A^m\\to A)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall\\bar a\\in A^m\\;\n\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\in A^n\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n):A^m\\to A\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash \\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A\\neq\\varnothing\\land C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\geq1\\to\\forall i&lt;n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\\;\n\\forall\\mathbf g\\in\\bigl(C\\cap(A^m\\to A)\\bigr)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\n\\in C\\cap(A^m\\to A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash \\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A\\neq\\varnothing\\land C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\geq1\\to\\forall i&lt;n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\\;\n\\forall\\mathbf g\\in\\bigl(C\\cap(A^m\\to A)\\bigr)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\n\\in C\\cap(A^m\\to A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Projection graphs, the tuple fed to the outer operation, and the resulting superposition graph are all explicit sets. The formulation covers nullary outer operations through the unique empty argument tuple.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Super}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clone}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf g:n\\to(A^m\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a\\in A^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)","display":false},{"tex":"f:A^n\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf g:n\\to(A^m\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar a(i)\\rangle:\\bar a\\in A^n\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\mathbf g(j)(\\bar a)\\rangle:j<n\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar a,\nf\\bigl(\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar a\\in A^m\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash{}&A\\neq\\varnothing\\land m,n\\in\\omega\n\\land f:A^n\\to A\\land\\mathbf g\\in(A^m\\to A)^n\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall\\bar a\\in A^m\\;\n\\operatorname{ArgTuple}_{93}(\\mathbf g,n,\\bar a)\\in A^n\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n):A^m\\to A\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}clone}\\vdash \\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&A\\neq\\varnothing\\land C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\geq1\\to\\forall i<n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Proj}_{93}(A,n,i)\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\\;\n\\forall\\mathbf g\\in\\bigl(C\\cap(A^m\\to A)\\bigr)^n\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\n\\in C\\cap(A^m\\to A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2434,"backlinks":[{"id":"0fab5c338808585f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Clone}$ is the clone predicate of [[93-df-clone]]."},{"id":"03ecb67f86ea10f0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"41a00088f1898c65","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Super}_{93}$ is the explicit superposition constructor of [[93-df-clone]]."}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}